 none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <font color=\"#050099\">▶</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#050099\"> 2013년 취업동아리 모집&nbsp;◀ </font></span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?XML:NAMESPACE PREFIX = O /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">▣ </span></span><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업동아리 신청요건<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업동아리 구성요건<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">본교 재적생 및 미취업 졸업생 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명 이상으로 구성되어야 함(대학원생 제외)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">단</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">휴학생 및 미취업 졸업생은 구성원의 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">20% </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이하로 함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업 및 진로와 관련하여 뚜렷한 목적성이 있어야 함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업동아리 구성분야<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">특정기업 및 그룹사의 진출<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">특정 업</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">직종의 진출<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기타 취업과 관련된 분야<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">단</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">외국어 학습</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전공 관련 스터디 등 취업과 직접적인 관련이 없는 분야는 제외<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><br>▣ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신청기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: <strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">2013. 04. 29(</font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ 05. 03(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">금</span></font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">) 09:00~18:00<br></font></strong></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><br>▣ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신청방법 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">동아리대표가 구비서류 작성 후 취업지원본부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">도서관</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">210</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">호</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">로 방문접수<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><br>▣ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">구비서류</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업동아리 등록신청서</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">활동계획서</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">회원명부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">붙임 참조</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><br>▣ </span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">동아리 선정 및 평가</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></font><span style=\"FONT-